<Base
  title="Install Hearth CLI · Hearth"
  description="Install the Hearth CLI from source."
  locale="en"
  path="/install/cli"
>
  <p class="text-ink/70 text-sm font-medium tracking-wider uppercase">Setup · CLI</p>
  <h1>Install<br/>Hearth CLI.</h1>
  <p>Install the <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/hearth/id6764480247?mt=12">Hearth app</a> from the Mac App Store first. The CLI is an optional developer feature.</p>

  <h2>Step 1 — Install from source</h2>
  <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/withgenie/hearth.git
cd hearth
cargo install --path src-tauri/cli</code></pre>

  <h2>Step 2 — Verify</h2>
  <pre><code>hearth --version</code></pre>
  <p>If it prints a Hearth 1.1–compatible version, you're done.</p>

  <h2>Requirements</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>macOS 12 or later</li>
    <li>Rust 1.75 or later</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Uninstall</h2>
  <pre><code>cargo uninstall hearth-cli</code></pre>

  <h2>Next step</h2>
  <p>Run <code>hearth --help</code> to see the available commands.</p>
</Base>
